{"type":"text","timestamp":1794359224578,"sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","part":{"id":"prt_1c824e8ef001Z95BkCXF355us0","messageID":"msg_1c824d491001ihOfzfeum0ugs3","sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","type":"text","text":"The lock file has a subtle issue: Flask 3.1.3 downloaded from the cache has hash `f4bc...` but the lock lists `0ef0...` first. Since the lock enables `--require-hashes` mode, pip wants all hashes for each package. Let me check whether the Docker build would succeed — it uses the same command. The safest fix: add the missing hash to the lock, or regenerate. Let me inspect which hash matches.","time":{"start":1794359224559,"end":1794359224574}}}
