{"type":"text","timestamp":1794359230166,"sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","part":{"id":"prt_1c824fea7001lJcqfXUef7XrqJ","messageID":"msg_1c824ea62001WUhwDN5wN1IuD5","sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","type":"text","text":"The lock's Flask hashes don't include the cached wheel's hash (`f4bc...`). Since the Docker build uses `-c requirements.lock` with hashed entries, I need to fix this. Easiest robust approach: add the correct hash to the flask entry. Let me add it.","time":{"start":1794359230119,"end":1794359230136}}}
