{"type":"text","timestamp":1794359664223,"sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","part":{"id":"prt_1c82b9d53001rMTn3jhuR0cAAH","messageID":"msg_1c82b897f001o6DtBQZN76Li8U","sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","type":"text","text":"Docker isn't available in the sandbox, but I've already validated the exact pip install command and the frontend `npm run build` that the Dockerfile runs. Let me double-check the Dockerfile's frontend step uses `npm ci`, which requires the lock file to be in sync with package.json. I modified package.json (added tailwind + TS deps), so I must ensure `package-lock.json` is updated — `npm install` already regenerated it. Let me verify `npm ci` works cleanly.","time":{"start":1794359663955,"end":1794359664220}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794359670993,"sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-85f7b6736403ca6e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/frontend && rm -rf node_modules && npm ci --no-audit --no-fund 2>&1 | tail -8 && echo \"=== build ===\" && npm run build 2>&1 | tail -8","timeout":240000},"output":"\nadded 39 packages in 2s\n=== build ===\n✓ 17 modules transformed.\nrendering chunks...\ncomputing gzip size...\ndist/index.html                   0.39 kB │ gzip:  0.27 kB\ndist/assets/index-Dtk0OeP5.css   16.31 kB │ gzip:  4.12 kB\ndist/assets/index-W1vwOWW0.js   229.92 kB │ gzip: 71.52 kB\n\n✓ built in 388ms\n","metadata":{"output":"\nadded 39 packages in 2s\n=== build ===\n✓ 17 modules transformed.\nrendering chunks...\ncomputing gzip size...\ndist/index.html                   0.39 kB │ gzip:  0.27 kB\ndist/assets/index-Dtk0OeP5.css   16.31 kB │ gzip:  4.12 kB\ndist/assets/index-W1vwOWW0.js   229.92 kB │ gzip: 71.52 kB\n\n✓ built in 388ms\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/frontend && rm -rf node_modules && npm ci --no-audit --no-fund 2>&1 | tail -8 && echo \"=== build ===\" && npm run build 2>&1 | tail -8","time":{"start":1794359663968,"end":1794359670964}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c82b9d58001Fg9cIpUQrdT6h4","sessionID":"ses_e37ddf413ffevYpMDlGQN6cfWY","messageID":"msg_1c82b897f001o6DtBQZN76Li8U"}}
